    {
      "_id": "3Go4L29o56YqQBfO",
      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The inquistor is a 14th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting modifier is Intelligence (spell save DC 17 , +9 to hit with spell attacks). It regains its expended spell slots when it finishes a short or long rest. It has the following warlock spells prepared. Cantrips (at will): <em>chill touch, diabolism, fel flame, mage hand, shadow bolt</em> 1st-5th level (three 5th level slots): <em>bane, cause fear, drain life, hex, ray of sickness, hold person, bestow curse, hunger of hadar, blight, compulsion, dominate person</em></p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
